WEBVTT

00:04:25.917 --> 00:04:30.529
regardless of what they earn,
where they live,

00:04:30.553 --> 00:04:32.846
or what society says about them.

00:04:33.449 --> 00:04:35.421
Patrick, Debbie and Wael

00:04:35.445 --> 00:04:39.071
are only three examples
out of the 1,700 accepted students

00:04:39.095 --> 00:04:41.446
from 143 countries.

00:04:43.492 --> 00:04:44.872
(Applause)

00:04:44.896 --> 00:04:46.172
Thank you.

00:04:46.196 --> 00:04:48.004
(Applause)

00:04:48.028 --> 00:04:50.249
We didn't need to reinvent the wheel.

00:04:50.273 --> 00:04:52.785
We just looked at what wasn't working

00:04:52.809 --> 00:04:55.548
and used the amazing power of the Internet

00:04:55.572 --> 00:04:56.868
to get around it.

00:04:57.386 --> 00:04:59.923
We set out to build a model